            <div xml:id="d355">

                <pb facs="0512" n="442" xml:id="pg442"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.01/1: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-14T23:00:00+01:00"
                            >November 14, 1918—11 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 15—12:21 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2353. Learn that Italy has in contemplation creation of 5 new provinces,
                    Dalmatia, Trieste, Trentino, Gorizia, Bolzano. They may have already matured
                    plans.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
